tion><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Edge0/Audio8-ASR-Infinite</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Audio8 ASR Infinite 是一款专为实时语音识别优化的流式模型。支持自定义音频时钟与转写延迟，配合适配的 vLLM 构建，可实现长音频 24/7 不间断的稳定转写，且具备低延迟与高响应速度，适用于长时间会议记录、实时字幕等需要高可靠性的场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-01/02-convaiinnovations-laya.png\" alt=\"convaiinnovations/laya\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">convaiinnovations/laya</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Laya 是一款多语言非自回归决策模型，仅需单次前向传播（33毫秒）即可处理超过百种语言。该模型通过 RLCD 技术训练，专注于根据输入信息返回带校准概率的结构化答案，不生成文本内容，杜绝了幻觉与解析问题，适用于邮件分类、工单自动化等高精度决策任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#3 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-01/03-xingchen-agi-teleocr.png\" alt=\"XingChen-AGI/TeleOCR\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">XingChen-AGI/TeleOCR</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">TeleOCR 是一款专注于文档解析的专业模型，旨在解决数字文档与相机拍摄文档在处理过程中的技术挑战。该模型通过优化 OCR 识别流程，能够高效提取各类复杂格式文档中的关键信息，适用于企业文档自动化处理、图像文字识别以及数字化办公场景。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#4 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-01/04-abenzerps-qwen-image-2-1-uncensored-gguf.png\" alt=\"abenzerps/Qwen-Image-2.1-Uncensored-GGUF\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">abenzerps/Qwen-Image-2.1-Uncensored-GGUF</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Qwen-Image-2.1-Uncensored-GGUF 是基于 Qwen-Image-2.1 模型构建的 GGUF 量化版本。该版本保留了原始上游权重，专为本地化部署设计，旨在降低硬件算力需求并提升图像生成性能，适合需要在离线环境下进行图像创作的开发者使用。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#5 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-01/05-contrastive-lm-clm-v0-1-8b.png\" alt=\"Contrastive-LM/CLM-v0.1-8B\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">Contrastive-LM/CLM-v0.1-8B</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">CLM-v0.1-8B 是一款基于对比学习架构的语言模型。该模型通过引入对比学习机制优化了语义表征，旨在提升模型在复杂语境下的理解深度与生成质量。作为一款 8B 参数规模的模型，它在平衡计算资源占用与性能表现方面进行了优化，适用于多种通用语言处理任务。</p></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qHfXxy1pes1eXWicJWxHTLGxL323Gh029A2JkOLQP3EibEU